   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 13481,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 59651,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1924",
   "x": 2837.199999999999,
   "y": 1412.0,
   "width": 354.19999999999993,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "1. EditorContext があるのに使い切れていない",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. EditorContext があるのに使い切れていない",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 13488,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 59682,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1925",
   "x": 2837.199999999999,
   "y": 1432.0,
   "width": 655.0000000000009,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    PanelManager が EditorContext を持っているのに、パネルは各自 Instance()。\n    よく使うもの(MainEngine / SceneManager / ResourceManager / AssetDatabase)\n    を載せれば、パネル側は Context だけ見ればよくなる。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    PanelManager が EditorContext を持っているのに、パネルは各自 Instance()。\n    よく使うもの(MainEngine / SceneManager / ResourceManager / AssetDatabase)\n    を載せれば、パネル側は Context だけ見ればよくなる。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 13495,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 59713,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1926",
   "x": 2837.199999999999,
   "y": 1512.0,
   "width": 486.8000000000002,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "2. SceneViewPanel(7個) と EffectEditor(7個) が突出している",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "2. SceneViewPanel(7個) と EffectEditor(7個) が突出している",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 13502,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 59744,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1927",
   "x": 2837.199999999999,
   "y": 1532.0,
   "width": 514.4,
   "height": 60.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    EffectEditor は専用ワールドを持つほぼミニアプリ。\n    パネルではなく別レイヤーとして切り出したほうが見通しがよい。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    EffectEditor は専用ワールドを持つほぼミニアプリ。\n    パネルではなく別レイヤーとして切り出したほうが見通しがよい。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
